  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Efficiency and Conservation (WEC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Water Efficiency and Conservation Activity (the Activity) is to increase water use efficiency and conservation in Jordan by applying commercial incentives to the agriculture, industrial, and the municipal sectors and strengthening the Government of Jordan (GOJ) governance over irrigated agriculture.</narrative>
  </description>
